OL,3,GNEWSAReported bird flu case being
OL,4,Ainvestigated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reported case of bird flu at a
OL,7,Fcommercial poultry farm in County
OL,8,FTyrone is under investigation.
OL,10,F"Significant" mortality and clinical
OL,11,Fsigns consistent with the disease were
OL,12,Fobserved at the site and movement
OL,13,Frestrictions have been imposed.
OL,15,FSamples have been sent to the national
OL,16,Freference laboratory in England for
OL,17,Fanalysis, with results expected on
OL,18,FMonday.
OL,20,FThe flock will be culled if avian
OL,21,Finfluenza is confirmed.
